    rdfs:label "UN/CEFACT code lists" ;
    rdfs:comment "OWL typing for the vendored UN/CEFACT code lists. The upstream vocabulary declares each list as rdfs:Class and its codes as plain typed nodes whose name is in rdfs:comment; OWL-based consumers need owl:Class, owl:NamedIndividual and rdfs:label. Every triple here is derived mechanically from the extract. Generated by scripts/download_uncefact_codelists.py; do not hand-edit." ;
